    "en": {
      "trackName": "Fluffy Adventure!",
      "description": "*Game Features\n Easy and Intuitive Controls!\nJump with a tap and move left or right with the Digital Crown. Enjoy smooth gameplay optimized for Apple Watch! Dodge obstacles and collect tickets as you go.\n\n Challenge Yourself and Beat Your High Score!\nCollect tickets to increase the difficulty! Push your limits from the beginner-friendly Lv1 to the ultimate LvX. Aim for the highest score and set new records!\n\n Unlock New Animals!\nUse collected tickets to get new animals! Collect over 10 types to unlock a secret mode!\n\n Enjoy Your Animal Collection in the Encyclopedia!\nAll acquired animals are registered in your encyclopedia. Choose your favorite one and take them on an adventure!\n\n Unique Animal Attacks!\nSome animals have special attack actions, making gameplay even more exciting!\n\n*Perfect for Those Who:\n Want a quick and easy game to play\n Love collecting cute animals\n Enjoy gaming on their Apple Watch during short breaks\n\n*Download Now!\nJoin adorable animals on an exciting adventure with your Apple Watch!\nSearch for \"Fluffy Adventure!\" on the App Store and start playing today!",
